-- the combination Σ c_i u_i (a missing coefficient is the zero), Σ c_i² F(u_i, u_i), and whether some coefficient
-- at a vector's place is nonzero
sy-comb : (A V : Type) → V → (V → V → V) → (A → V → V) → A → List A → List V → V
sy-comb A V vz va vs z cs us = case us of
  nil → vz
  cons u ur → va (vs (cl-hd A z cs) u) (sy-comb A V vz va vs z (cl-tl A cs) ur)
